Software Requirements Specification (SRS)

Module: User Authentication and Access Control

1. Purpose

1. The system shall provide secure login for registered users.
2. It shall verify user identity before granting access.
3. It shall control access based on user roles and permissions.
4. It shall prevent unauthorized users from accessing protected resources.
5. It shall allow administrators to manage user accounts.
6. It shall provide secure password management.
7. It shall maintain basic records of important security activities.
